Segmentation Biomarker CTC - License and Usage Notice
========================================================

Copyright (c) Alexandre Matov. All rights reserved except as granted below.

1. Scope
--------
This repository contains software written or co-written by Alexandre Matov
for the segmentation of prostate-specific membrane antigen (PSMA) labeling
in circulating tumor cells (CTCs) of metastatic patients, at both high and
low resolution (see README.md for the repository layout).

