-----------------
Permission is granted to use, copy, and modify the Alexandre Matov-authored
code in this repository free of charge for research and educational
purposes, provided that:

  a) Any resulting publication, presentation, or derivative work cites
     the relevant publication(s) referenced in README.md;
  b) This notice is retained in copies or substantial portions of the
     code.

Commercial use, redistribution, or incorporation into a commercial product
or service requires prior written permission from Alexandre Matov
(alexandre.matov@gmail.com).

