4. Third-party components
--------------------------
Several subdirectories bundle or adapt code by other authors, retained
here for reference and NOT relicensed by the terms above. Each retains
the license/attribution terms of its original author:

  - additional_tools/SVM/    Support Vector Machine classification code
                             by Issam El Naqa, PhD.
